  "purpose": "OPTIONAL menu of diverse story shapes drawn from the viditor references and our own films. INSPIRATION ONLY: every film defines its own story (own logline, protagonist/object, emotional arc, payoffs) from its goal; using a shape is optional, must be justified in the film.html header, and a reference is never copied.",
  "numbers_from": "docs/motion/knowledge/ref-pacing-summary.json (9:16 median shot 2.5 s, 2.7 cuts/10 s; 16:9 teaser median shot 4.0 s, 2.0 cuts/10 s; hold floor 0.6 s + 0.045 s per Persian char)",
  "units": "weight = share of total bars; min 2 beats per scene; cut lands on a bar downbeat; sound hit on the cut or on the payoff beat",
  "bpm_range": [
   100,
   124
  ]
